{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02680","headline":"踏歌词三首 二 · 谢偃","name":"踏歌词三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"逶迤度香合，顾步出兰闺。\n欲绕鸳鸯殿，先过桃李蹊。\n风带舒还卷，簪花举复低。\n欲问今宵乐，但听歌声齐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"谢偃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02680.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02680","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}